# IC Skills — Code Owners
# PRs touching these paths auto-request review from the listed GitHub users.
#
# GitHub applies ONLY the last matching pattern — rules do not accumulate, and
# there is no "global fallback owner" concept. So the repo-wide approvers who
# may sign off on anything (@JoshDFN, @dfinity/sdk) have to be repeated on
# EVERY rule below. Omit them from a new rule and they are silently locked out
# of that path. `npm run validate` enforces this; see scripts/check-project.js.
#
# Multiple owners on one line are an OR: any single one of them satisfies the
# required code-owner review.

* @dfinity/sdk

